<title>Historic Season for Mid Michigan College Athletics | Mid Michigan College - Harrison, MI - Mt. Pleasant, MI - Online</title>
    <meta content="Mid Michigan College Athletics is celebrating a milestone year as the Lakers captured conference championships, earned national tournament berths, and set records during an extraordinary winter season. Both the Men&#8217;s and Women&#8217;s Basketball teams secured spots in the NJCAA Division II Basketball Championships, while the Women&#8217;s Bowling team achieved the highest national finish in Mid Michigan College history." name="description"/>
    <meta content="lakers, laker athletics, athletics, basketball, women's basketball, men's basketball, bowling, softball" name="keywords"/>
